    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d537">

                <pb facs="0586" n="580" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg580"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Herbert to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-11-02"><hi rendition="#italic">November 2,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my note of the 3d of
                    October last, I have the honor to inclose the copy of the note from the Marquis
                    of Salisbury to Count Hatzfeldt, of the 12th of August, which should have
                    accompanied my note of the 26th August last, in regard to the difference of
                    opinion <pb facs="0587" n="581" xml:id="pg581"/> which has arisen as to the
                    apportionment of the import and export duties in Samoa.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to renew at the same time the expression of my regret that the
                    wrong inclosure should have been sent you with my note of the 26th August.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Michael H.
                    Herbert.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
